 deep appreciation for the unique bond between pets and the people who love them. Whether you choose a name today or spend weeks finding the perfect match, the right name will feel inevitable once discovered, as though your companion could never have been called anything else.\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"36:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Do male cats respond better to certain types of names?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Male cats respond best to names with clear consonant sounds and one to two syllables. Names ending in higher-pitched sounds may capture feline attention more effectively. The most important factor is consistent use paired with positive reinforcement like treats and affection during name training.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Should I give my male cat a 'tough' name?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Tough names like Hunter, Maverick, or Diesel work wonderfully for male cats, especially those with bold, adventurous personalities. The contrast between a fearsome name and a cuddly cat cre